---
layout: layouts/base.njk
---
{% set prefix = "/en" if lang == "en" else "" %}
<main id="main-content">
  <section class="page-hero">
    <img class="hero-media" src="/images/web/product-library-20260722/overview.jpg" alt="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" eleventy:widths="640,960,1440,1920" sizes="100vw">
    <div class="container page-hero-inner">
      <nav class="breadcrumbs"><a href="{{ prefix }}/">{% if lang == "en" %}Home{% else %}首页{% endif %}</a><span>/</span><span>{% if lang == "en" %}Products{% else %}产品目录{% endif %}</span></nav>
      <span class="eyebrow">PRODUCT DIRECTORY</span>
      <h1>{% if lang == "en" %}Industrial machine knives by application{% else %}工业机械刀具产品分类{% endif %}</h1>
      <p>{% if lang == "en" %}Products are classified by industry, equipment and typical application. Manufacturing review is based on drawings, physical samples, machine information and operating requirements.{% else %}产品按行业、设备与典型应用分类。制造评估以图纸、实物样品、设备型号和工况资料为依据。{% endif %}</p>
      <div class="page-hero-actions">
        <a class="button button-dark" href="#product-directory">{% if lang == "en" %}Find a product category{% else %}按应用选择产品{% endif %}</a>
        <a class="button button-outline" href="{{ prefix }}/rfq/">{% if lang == "en" %}Start a technical RFQ{% else %}按现有资料询价{% endif %}</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section section-soft" id="product-directory">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-head">
        <div><span class="eyebrow">APPLICATION DIRECTORY</span><h2>{% if lang == "en" %}Choose the closest equipment application{% else %}选择最接近的设备与应用{% endif %}</h2></div>
        <p>{% if lang == "en" %}An exact product classification is not required to begin. Use the nearest machine type and processed material, then provide the available drawing, sample or operating information.{% else %}启动询价无需先确定准确分类。请选择最接近的设备类型和被处理材料，再提交现有图纸、样品或工况资料。{% endif %}</p>
      </div>
      <div class="product-grid">
        {% for product in catalog.products %}
          {% include "partials/product-card.njk" %}
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
      <div class="product-directory-assist">
        <div><span class="eyebrow">APPLICATION REVIEW</span><h3>{% if lang == "en" %}Not sure which category fits{% else %}暂不确定产品分类{% endif %}</h3></div>
        <p>{% if lang == "en" %}Start with the machine, processed material and current cutting problem. The engineering team will identify the applicable review path from those inputs.{% else %}可从设备、被处理材料及当前切割问题开始，工程团队将依据这些资料判断适用的评估路径。{% endif %}</p>
        <a class="text-link" href="{{ prefix }}/rfq/?type=application#rfq-form">{% if lang == "en" %}Start from an application{% else %}从设备工况开始询价{% endif %}<span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section" id="product-photo-library">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-head">
        <div><span class="eyebrow">PRODUCT PHOTO LIBRARY</span><h2>{% if lang == "en" %}Professional product photography by source category{% else %}按原始分类查看专业产品实拍{% endif %}</h2></div>
        <p>{% if lang == "en" %}All photographs remain in the five categories supplied with the source files. Open a category to review the complete set without reassigning products across folders.{% else %}全部照片严格沿用原文件夹的五类名称与归属，不跨文件夹重新判断或调整产品类别。进入分类可查看该文件夹的完整照片。{% endif %}</p>
      </div>
      <div class="product-library-grid">
        {% for group in productPhotoLibrary.groups %}
        <a class="product-library-group" href="{{ prefix }}/products/gallery/{{ group.slug }}/">
          <div class="product-library-media"><img src="{{ group.representative }}" alt="{{ group.representativeAlt[lang] }}" loading="lazy" eleventy:widths="320,640,960" sizes="(min-width: 1080px) 20vw, (min-width: 640px) 33vw, 50vw"></div>
          <div class="product-library-copy"><span class="eyebrow">0{{ loop.index }} / {{ group.photoCount }} PHOTOS</span><h3>{{ group.name[lang] }}</h3><span class="text-link">{% if lang == "en" %}Open photo category{% else %}查看完整分类{% endif %}<i aria-hidden="true">→</i></span></div>
        </a>
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section section-soft">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="content-grid">
        <div class="content-block"><span class="eyebrow">SELECTION CRITERIA</span><h2>{% if lang == "en" %}Selection and manufacturing review criteria{% else %}选型与制造评估要素{% endif %}</h2><p>{% if lang == "en" %}Machine configuration, processed material and operating conditions may require different material grades, heat-treatment processes, edge geometries and inspection plans for the same general blade type.{% else %}同一通用刀型在不同设备、被处理材料与工况下，可能采用不同的材料牌号、热处理工艺、刃口几何及检验方案。{% endif %}</p></div>
        <div class="notice">{% if lang == "en" %}Material grade, hardness, tolerance, lead time and target service life are confirmed after drawing and application review.{% else %}材料牌号、硬度、公差、交期及预期使用寿命需经图纸与工况评估后确认。{% endif %}</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  {% include "partials/rfq-cta.njk" %}
</main>
